From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:08:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 44/97] Neutral names for the Metal host seam and debug knobs;
 drop Tarzan-only traces

TARZAN_USE_METAL -> PS2X_USE_METAL, tarzan_metal_*/tarzan_gamepad_* ->
ps2x_metal_*/ps2x_gamepad_*, TARZAN_TRACE_* -> PS2X_TRACE_*, the FFmpeg hint
root is RX_ROOT. The readMpeg skip and the VU0 skinning trace keyed on one
game's guest PCs and are removed.

diff --git a/ps2xIOP/src/emulator/core/iop_cpu.cpp b/ps2xIOP/src/emulator/core/iop_cpu.cpp
